					Od.
					18.27
				</span></i>
			. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span> in
			fut. and aor., and late 
				Act.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτῑον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					1333
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span> in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητίομαι</span> Pi.l.c.]</div>
